007D   18F4           00057         BTFSC   Select,RS       ; Test RS bit
007E   1488           00058         BSF     PORTD,RS        ; and set for data
007F   2075           00059         CALL    pulseE          ; and clock display register
0080   206A           00060         CALL    onems           ; wait 1ms for display
